Z||000006||fierospeeder||03-21-2001||12:06 AM||||My dads the same way.  He doesn't fix cars or really much anything.<P>We have a 88 celebrity wagon, that no one has maintained and we are going to trade it in.  Theres things im fixing on it that has gone bad.  ac compressor locking up, fuel lines rusting and leaking gas.  It totally needs a new fuel line from the fuel filter to the gas tank.  Its coated with rust just like mold on bread.<P>My dad would say" the car was fine until you drove it"<P>go to <A HREF="http://www.alldata.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.alldata.com</A>   if someone already mentioned this, about going to see the bulletins.<P>you can see tons of bulletins for every car.  The cars on the road are NOT PERFECT.||||reg||1
